  "description": "A .NET library for Kaspa. The public API follows NBitcoin where a Kaspa counterpart exists. This alpha covers addresses, keys, scripts, transactions, BIP39, BIP32, PSKT, fees, and a minimal wRPC client.",
  "id": "NKaspa",
  "isPrerelease": true,
